<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
  <header class="mb-16 text-center">
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">Why freediving</p>
    <h1 class="mb-5 mt-0 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Freediving gives your life back.</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl">Deeper means calmer.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Equalize early, turn when planned and surface with enough reserve for a calm recovery breath.</p>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Molchanovs Wave 1 and Wave 2 certification is available. In water, always train with an active, qualified buddy and stay within conservative limits.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl">Water teaches calm for life.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Children float, swim, glide and dive with a qualified instructor beside them, one skill at a time.</p>
  </section>

